//   - CloseConstrainedSpan: sets insideConstrainedOut := false, making implication vacuous.
//   - SafeRepetitionPenaltyStep: returns EOS or parser-valid next token; 
//     AppendConstrainedToken preserves IsValidPrefix.
//   - AdaptiveConstrainedStep: same guarantee.
//
// progress (|generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps):
//   - Each branch increments steps by at least 1 and appends at most 1 token to generated.
//   - OpenConstrainedSpan: appends "<<" (1 token) and costs 1 step.
//   - RollbackConstrainedToComplete: costs 0, but may shorten generated (never grows it).
//   - CloseConstrainedSpan: appends ">>" (1 token) and costs 1 step.
//   - All constrained steps cost 1 step and append at most 1 token.
//   Thus |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps throughout.
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END
