// (or similar preamble), then forcibly open a constrained span with
// OpenConstrainedSpan (which appends "<<" and costs 1 step). This prevents
// the model from spending all budget in free generation.
//
// Inside the constrained span:
// - Use AdaptiveConstrainedStep with group boosts when parser is narrow.
// - Use SafeRepetitionPenaltyStep when parser is wide.
// - Close immediately when IsCompletePrefix is satisfied.
// - If EOS is returned, rollback to complete and close if possible.
//
// This guarantees that:
// 1. We always open the span within the first few steps (no infinite free loop).
// 2. SQL content is always parser-controlled.
