//     prefix, preserving IsValidPrefix.
//
// progress (|generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps):
//   - Phase 1: each iteration increments steps by 1 and appends at most 1 token.
//   - OpenConstrainedSpan: increments steps by 1, appends "<<" (1 token).
//   - Phase 2: each call to a generation helper increments steps by 1;
//     AppendConstrainedToken appends 1 token; CloseConstrainedSpan appends ">>" (1 token)
//     and increments steps by 1; RollbackConstrainedToComplete costs 0 and only shortens.
//     So |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps is maintained.
